    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hibernian Auctioneers are delighted to bring\r\n52 Railway Avenue Dublin 8 to the market. \r\n \r\nA rare opportunity to acquire this exceptional property of excellent proportions and stunning design located within the mature setting of Inchicore and surrounding established areas   \r\n\r\nThe residence is a superb 3-bedroomed mid terrace red brick residence which has been extended to the rear, private courtyard garden and      on street parking to the front and within a short stroll of amenities and Luas Red line at Blackhorse    \r\n\r\nThis property is situated within an excellent position on a tree-lined street and facing green and park. The property has been beautifully renovated and provides for a charming contemporary living space within the heart of a thriving community which is within easy distance of city centre location and major road networks and M50  \r\n\r\nThe property offers c. 66 sq. meters of living space over two floors \r\n\r\nTo fully appreciate the living space and level of décor this property has to offer viewing is a must, truly a home to start your dream"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation in Brief:\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\n\r\nOpen porch to Entrance    \r\n\r\nMain Reception and Extended Living Dining   \r\nc. 8.50 m x 3.60m \r\n\r\nBathroom with Utility c. 2.24 x 2.37 m\r\nModern Fully Tiled – Pump Shower \r\nUtility area\r\n\r\nLobby Area c. 3.22 m x 0.88 m \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Ground Floor) c 3.05 m x 3.29 m \r\nDoor leading onto courtyard Garden \r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Front  c. 2.89 m x 2.18 m \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Rear  c. 3.18 m x 2.86 m  \r\n\r\n\r\nIn addition amazing benefit an enclosed private courtyard and entertaining space to the rear of the property which truly is an extension of the living space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil Fired Heating System\r\nModern Contemporary Decor\r\n3 Bedrooms\r\nModern Kitchen\r\nExtended   \r\nDouble Glazed Windows  \r\nPlantation Shutters to Windows \r\nRemote Operated Electronic skylight\r\nMature Location \r\nNo Onward Chain  \r\nClose to all Amenities & Lucas   \r\nc. 66 sqm of Living Space  \r\nOn Street Parking to Front  \r\nViewing highly recommended – By prior Appointment"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing is highly recommended, strictly by prior appointment.  \r\n\r\nTo arrange viewing or discuss further aspect of this property please don't hesitate to contact. \r\n\r\nGerard Hyland on mobile 087 22 04 158 or Office 01 457 5780\r\n\r\n\r\nThe details & particulars contained within this brochure, are for guidance only and do not form part of any contract or intent to contract. While every care has been taken in the preparation, we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies. They are issued on the understanding that all negotiations will be conducted through this firm. While every care is taken in the preparation of details with regard to description and measurement, the individual will need to satisfy themselves as to correctness © Hibernian Auctioneers Ltd 2026"
      }
    ],
